    "reference": "Deserts are located in various regions worldwide, including North Africa (Algeria, Chad, Egypt, etc.), Western Asia (Iraq, Jordan, Saudi Arabia, etc.), Central Asia (China, Mongolia), and Southern Africa (Angola, Botswana, Namibia, etc.). Australia contains several deserts, such as the Great Victoria, Great Sandy, Gibson, and Simpson deserts. North America's deserts include the Chihuahuan, Sonoran, and Mojave, while South America features the Atacama and Patagonian deserts."
